{"id":"c124febdf2156c88","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Invariant Sigma Algebra","display":"df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure8 Invariant Sigma Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure8 Invariant Sigma Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure8 Invariant Sigma Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,T,\\mathcal A,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal I,T,\\mathcal A,X\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land T\\in X^X\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\in\\mathcal A\\mid T^{-1}[A]=A\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land T\\in X^X\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\in\\mathcal A\\mid T^{-1}[A]=A\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The invariant sigma-algebra is returned as an explicit set and the transformation is required to be measurable.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-sigma-algebra]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对函数图 $f$ 与集合 $B$，$f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}$；函数图及定义域使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal I,T,\\mathcal A,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}invariant\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8InvariantSigmaAlgebra}_S(\\mathcal I,T,\\mathcal A,X)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land T\\in X^X\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathcal I=\\{A\\in\\mathcal A\\mid T^{-1}[A]=A\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1257,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2651","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra.md|58-df-zfc-measure8-invariant-sigma-algebra]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","a740bdad87b97ac6"]}